name 'building-data-driven-systems-preassessment-q5_2025'

question 'You want to add a new user to the very end of a "Waiting List" array. Which method is designed for this task?'

wrong '`.pop()`'
right '`.push()`'
wrong '`.shift()`'
wrong '`.unshift()`'

allow_multiple_attempts false

teacher_markdown <<MARKDOWN
Lesson 3

`.push()` adds elements to the end of an array. `.unshift()` adds to the beginning, `.pop()` removes from the end, and `.shift()` removes from the beginning.
MARKDOWN
